There are some remarkable photos in this article.

1) Damage at the Prince Sultan Air Base in Saudi Arabia following Iranian strikes;

2) Burning aircraft at the Prince Sultan Air Base in Saudi Arabia;

3) Fire seen against the silhouette of an F-15 fighter jet stationed at the Muwaffaq Salti Air Base in Jordan;

4) The crater from the impact of an Iranian ballistic missile at the Muwaffaq Salti Air Base in Jordan.

